From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.web: Windows.Data.Json values, objects and arrays (2011)

windows.web: Windows.Data.Json values, objects and arrays (2011)

JsonValue is parsed (a strict JSON reader), stringified and read back
through its typed getters; JsonObject keeps members sorted by name with the
named getters and SetNamedValue; JsonArray has its typed getters and a
class factory. One object serves the value, object, array and IStringable
interfaces. Needs msvcrt for number conversion.
